[? if not dsu_in_gov: DuFour appoints the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalist</span> Reynold Goodlake—who renounces his party affiliation—to rule Heartland as <i>Commonwealth Commissioner</i>, tasked with dismantling the democratic systems we fought to build. ?][? if dsu_in_gov: DuFour appoints the <span style="color: #6A1E1E;">**DSU**</span>'s Garrick Crowde to rule Heartland as <i>Commonwealth Commissioner</i>, charged with ruthlessly tearing down the democratic structures we struggled to establish. On top of this, Frask is made Heartland Interior Minister. ?]

Future state elections have been postponed indefinitely, to be held only when the situation is deemed "stable enough."